# Docker Secrets - DO NOT COMMIT ACTUAL VALUES
#
# This directory contains sensitive credentials for Docker deployment.
# Only template files (.example) should be committed to version control.
#
# To set up secrets for deployment:
# 1. Copy each .example file to remove the .example extension
# 2. Replace placeholder values with actual credentials
# 3. Ensure file permissions are restricted (chmod 600 on Linux)
#
# Example:
#   cp db_password.txt.example db_password.txt
#   echo "your_actual_password" > db_password.txt
#   chmod 600 db_password.txt

# Actual secret files (git ignored)
db_password.txt
smtp_password.txt
sa_password.txt
ai_api_key.txt
